flowchart TD
  U1[Return request with reason code] --> U2{Policy check shelf life package window}
  U2 -- fail --> U3[Reject or override with permission and reason]
  U2 -- pass --> U4{Approver independent DEC-INV-16}
  U4 -- reject --> U5[REJECTED edit and resubmit]
  U4 -- approve --> U6[APPROVED awaiting goods]
  U6 --> U7[Physical receipt to QUARANTINE RECEIVED]
  U7 --> U8[Inspection by storekeeper or QA not creator]
  U8 -- sellable and shelf life ok --> U9[(WAREHOUSE)]
  U8 -- damaged or expired --> U10[(DAMAGED to damage sorting)]
  U8 --> U11[Credit for accepted lines only]
  U11 --> U12{Invoice paid}
  U12 -- no --> U13[Credit note reduces outstanding]
  U12 -- yes --> U14[Customer credit or refund payable then separate refund voucher]
  U9 --> U15[CLOSED]
  U10 --> U15
  U15 --> U16[Reversal path with approval if posted in error]
